  "chapter": {
    "number": 3,
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          "Deliver Me, O LORD!"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "line_break"
      },
      {
        "type": "hebrew_subtitle",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "A Psalm of David, when he fled from his son Absalom.",
            "poem": 1
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "line_break"
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 1,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "O LORD, how my foes have increased!",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "How many rise up against me!",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 2,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Many say of me,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "“God will not deliver him.” Selah",
            "poem": 2
          },
          {
            "noteId": 5
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 3,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "But You, O LORD, are a shield around me,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "my glory, and the One who lifts my head.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 4,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "To the LORD I cry aloud,",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "and He answers me from His holy mountain. Selah",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 5,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "I lie down and sleep;",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "I wake again, for the LORD sustains me.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 6,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "I will not fear the myriads",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "set against me on every side.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "line_break"
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 7,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Arise, O LORD!",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "Save me, O my God!",
            "poem": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "Strike all my enemies on the jaw;",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "break the teeth of the wicked.",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 8,
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Salvation belongs to the LORD;",
            "poem": 1
          },
          {
            "text": "may Your blessing be on Your people. Selah",
            "poem": 2
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "footnotes": [
      {
        "noteId": 5,
        "text": "Selah or Interlude is probably a musical or literary term; here and throughout the Psalms.",
